          <p class="terms-clause-body">We proudly offer tracked worldwide express shipping to pet parents across the globe (including North America, Europe, United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand, Latin America, and Asia-Pacific). In strict compliance with international postal regulations, export sanctions, and carrier safety protocols, we do not ship to active armed conflict zones, sanctioned territories, or regions under total postal disruption.</p>
