        </div>

        <div class="terms-clause">
          <h3 class="terms-clause-title">3. What We Do Not Accept</h3>
          <p class="terms-clause-body">We do NOT accept orders destined for sanctioned territories or active conflict zones where international courier services are suspended. We do NOT accept Cash on Delivery (COD), personal checks, money orders, or unverified wire transfers. We do NOT accept high-risk freight-forwarding reshipment addresses, and we do NOT cover damage caused by dog chewing, biting punctures, or intentional pet misuse.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="terms-clause">
          <h3 class="terms-clause-title">4. Strict All Sales Are Final & No-Refund Policy</h3>
          <p class="terms-clause-body">Once an order is paid and processed, all sales are strictly final. Due to strict pet hygiene and sanitary health protocols, we do not accept returns, exchanges, or refunds under any circumstances. Once payment is completed, all transactions are non-refundable and non-returnable. Please review your order details carefully before completing checkout.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

